      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Designed as a fully planned community, Canyon Creek features homes, parks, and interconnected trails that weave through the landscape.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canyon_Creek%2C_Austin%2C_Texas",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The neighborhood protects significant habitat for the golden‑cheeked warbler, an endangered bird native to central Texas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
